{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Patch set 3. Patch set 2 cleared the prompt-index gate and the whole optionality lane, but hit a THIRD derived-file gate the plan did not anticipate: docs/cli-reference.md is also DERIVED - generated from the CLI's own help data plus a curated intercept table in scripts/gen_cli_reference.py. The ticket's AC13 says to correct 'the review row at docs/cli-reference.md:478', but editing that row directly leaves the generator's source table stale and the CLI-reference drift gate fails.\n\nFixed by moving the corrected text into the generator's table entry for 'review' in scripts/gen_cli_reference.py and re-running 'python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py'. The regenerated docs/cli-reference.md is byte-identical to the earlier hand-edit (git reports no diff on the doc, only on the script), so the row's wording is unchanged and source and derived now agree.\n\nPattern worth naming for future tickets: THREE of this ticket's four named doc/config surfaces are generated, not hand-authored - src/rebar/llm/reviewers/index.json (from prompt front-matter), docs/cli-reference.md (from gen_cli_reference.py), docs/mcp-reference.md (from tool docstrings). Only docs/llm-framework.md, docs/output-schemas.md and AGENTS.md are hand-authored. A plan that cites a derived file by line number will send an implementer to the wrong file every time.\n\nBefore pushing ps3 I ran EVERY gate in the pytest job's pre-suite sequence locally, not just the ones that had already failed: module-size, prompt-index, env-var registry, docs-index, README quickstart, CLI-reference, MCP-reference, security-pin, criteria-routing parity, server.json env-contract, public-types, config-read - all OK - plus make lint and make typecheck."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785901220378529001,"uuid":"d5bd95c1-61f3-42c7-ba86-7886d298241b"}